# Normalize line endings: text files are stored as LF in the repo;
# working-tree endings follow each developer's platform settings.
* text=auto

# Files that must always keep LF (executed on Linux/CI)
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# TypeScript 來源:signal-api 的 bundle 來源指紋會讀這些檔案的內容,CRLF/LF 混用
# 會讓同一份原始碼在 Windows 與 Linux 得到不同答案。指紋函式本身也做換行正規化,
# 這是兩層保險裡的第一層。
*.ts text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
